WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.287
Step 4 runs the replication probe on the
first morning's saved replication report.

2
00:00:05.287 --> 00:00:08.925
Without the send switch, it writes
its file and sends nothing.

3
00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.963
Four links between the
fictional domain controllers.

4
00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:13.063
Two are healthy.

5
00:00:13.063 --> 00:00:17.398
Two are failing, nine failures each,
with status seventeen twenty-two,

6
00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:21.887
and both come from the third domain
controller, the one that went silent.

7
00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:26.075
The script exits with an error,
because a failing link is a finding.

8
00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:31.370
That record, not the tab, is what Chapter
4 sends to the workspace each morning.
